Hi {{contactName}},

I hope this note finds you well. My name is {{senderName}}, and I'm the {{senderTitle}} of {{organizationName}} — a new nonprofit focused on increasing AI literacy in rural South Carolina communities.

{{customParagraph}}

I've been following the work {{contactOrganization}} is doing, and I think there's a genuine connection between what you're building and what we're trying to do. {{goalStatement}}

I know your time is valuable, so I'll keep this brief — I'd love to find 20 minutes to introduce myself and share what we're working on. Would you be open to a quick conversation sometime in the next few weeks?

Thank you for your time.

Warm regards,
{{senderName}}
{{senderTitle}}, {{organizationName}}

