I know your inbox is probably as full as mine — I just wanted to make sure my message didn't slip through the cracks. {{followUpContext}}

If this isn't the right time or {{organizationName}} isn't a fit for {{contactOrganization}}, no worries at all — I'd rather know than wonder.

